{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-07-28 09:02:00', 'title': 'COLLINS AEROSPACE TO SUPPORT IATA TRAVEL PASS', 'text': 'ANNAPOLIS, MD., JULY,\xa028\xa02021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TO HELP PASSENGERS MANAGE THEIR TESTING REQUIREMENTS, GOVERNMENTS SAFELY RE-OPEN THEIR BORDERS, AND RESTART INTERNATIONAL AIR TRAVEL, COLLINS AEROSPACE, A RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX) BUSINESS, IS TEAMING WITH THE INTERNATIONAL AIR TRANSPORT ASSOCIATION (IATA) TO SUPPORT ITS TRAVEL PASS DIGITAL HEALTH PLATFORM.'}